WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:03,940
Chen Yaoyao is gone

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,380
You have a good conscience

3
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:09,410
The one who can’t sleep without Chen Yaoyao should be you.

4
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:18,540
She made a condition

5
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:21,860
What are the conditions for not giving medicine if you say it can't be done?

6
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:25,790
She wants me to apologize in public, that's all

7
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:29,270
Lin Xiyi, don’t hurt me when you talk here. I told you before.

8
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:32,350
She asked me to kneel down and apologize, and I knelt down on the spot. Now it's your turn.

9
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:35,740
An apology can save Chen Yao's life.

10
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:37,980
An apology changes a life

11
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:40,260
Even a three-year-old child can calculate this account

12
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:42,840
Weiwei I'm so cold

13
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:49,060
Rain, leave one for Weiwei

14
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:52,640
Isn't it just an apology?

15
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:54,860
I'll go, okay?
